# SuprBh Voyage Consulting Frameworks

## About

Welcome to the consulting framework repository of **SuprBh Voyage LLP**.

This repository contains practical frameworks, playbooks, templates, assessments, case studies, and training resources focused on helping organizations improve delivery, leadership, innovation, and business outcomes.

The content is designed for Agile Coaches, Scrum Masters, Product Owners, Release Train Engineers, Leaders, Trainers, Consultants, and Transformation Practitioners.

---

## Focus Areas

### Agile Transformation

* Agile Maturity Assessments
* Transformation Roadmaps
* Value Stream Mapping
* Lean Portfolio Management
* PI Planning Playbooks

### Agile Coaching

* Scrum Master Coaching Guides
* Product Owner Enablement
* Team Health Assessments
* Retrospective Playbooks
* Agile Facilitation Techniques

### Leadership Development

* Servant Leadership Frameworks
* Change Management
* Stakeholder Management
* Leadership Coaching Models

### AI Enablement

* AI for Agile Teams
* AI for Learning & Development
* Prompt Libraries
* Productivity Frameworks

### Corporate Training

* Workshop Designs
* Training Blueprints
* Facilitation Guides
* Enterprise Learning Resources

